        <p>An Insurance Agent In Trouble. At the Warrington Police Court on Thursday inorning, William Looker, insurance agent, Aismerly of Warrington, was charged with running mar from the borough and leaving his wife and child charge- able to the funds of the Warrington Union.—Mr. B. Shearer said that on the 4th of December prisoner's wife and child were admitted into the work licuse, as they had been deserted by the prisoner. A warrant lAwas taken cut for tisoner's apprehension, and he was arrested in War ngton on Wtw edsdaT. It appeared that in January last a tired of separation was drawn sap -tithe-10)y the wife was to receive 10s. weekly. The inoney was paid fur some time,but since July last pay- anent had ceased, and theta was about £l4 arrears.- -In reply to Mr. Steel, the wife admitted that she only stayed in the Workhouse a few days. She denied that in consequence of the reparation order her husband lost a situation as manager of a Lancashire insurance company.—For the defence it was contended by Mr. Steel that in view of the deed of separation there was no desertion. Prisoner bad only had casual employment in the North of England, and therefore could not fulfil his payments.— The magistrates sent prisoner to gaol for tvio mouths.</p>
        <p>LUNG TROUBLES. Most remarkable cures by vENO'S LIGHTNINU COUCiti CURE.</p>
        <p>The safety and wonderful efficacy of Veno'sLightninr,' Cough Cure in chest and lung troubles is again proved. Mrs. H. Rollins, of 55, Trentham-street, Southfieldi, ‘Vandsworth, writes :—" It is with pleasure I haxe to tell you of the enormous benefits my two sons derived from Veno's Lightning Cough Cure. Some time ago they were at death's door from pleurisy and congestion of the lungs, consequent on a severe cold, but now they are quite recovered. I can safely say that Veno's Lightning Cough Cure accomplished this. Your medicine deserves all the praise I can give it, for it has saved me pounds in doctor's bills, and I shall always recommend your great remedy to all my friends."</p>
        <p>Veno's Lightning Cangh Care is a safe and absolute cure for coughs, colds, bronchitis, asthma, catarrh, whooping cough, children's coughs, old-age coughs, and all chest and lung troubles. Price 9d, Is. lid., and 9J. of all chemists.</p>
