        <p>05' NEW AND ARTISTIC CHRISTMAS CARDS AND CALENDARS, BY THE INIOST FAMOUS ART PUBLISHERS. CHARMING PRODUCTIONS AT VERY SPECIAL PRICES. CHRISTMAS CARDS IN BOXES. SPECIAL SHILLING BOXES. The " COMPTON ANNUAL" BOX contains 13 Folding Leaflet Cards, with ribbon, all different designs, with Envelopes, WONDERFUL VALUE AT is. THE BOX. Postage 21d. Worth 2s. Gd. The " VALUE " BOX contains 25 Folding Leaflet Cards, all ribboned, at least eighteen different designs, complete with Envelopes, ASTONISHING VALUE AT is. THE BOX. Postage 21,d. Worth 2s. 63. The" MAYFAIR" BOX contains 12 Very Choice Leaflet Cards, all diffeTeut designs, with Envelopes, SPLENDID VALUB AT Is. THE BOX. Postage I Id. The "CROWN " BOX contains 21 High-class Folding Autograph Cards, without Envelopes, ONE SHILLING THE BOX. Postage 11-d. Worth 2s .6d. _</p>
