rice 111(1. each. DEAN'S FAMOUS RAG BOOKS, almost impossible to spoil or destroy. These are printed.. on strong cotton cloth, and can be washed as often as desired, the colours being fast, and rill not run, a splendid variety, prices 50., 110., Is. 111 d., ta. 6d., and 3s. 6d. each. TUCK'S LARGE PANORAMIC SCREENS, size 5 by 3 inches, untearable, fold up like a book, twenty pages of coloured pictures,Xmas prices 11Ad. and is. Jld., each.</p>
